(text "E4-08 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.3 (RX1, YAT-10A+, H1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1060b43d-8f0c-530d-9adc-b37ef0e7d33e))
(text "RX1 captive edge/pad/panel assembly and H1 attenuation have not been measured.\nВорота (стенд): Confirm edge → pad → panel → X2 without bypass. YAT 10±0.5 dB and RL ≥20 dB; H1 total ≥12.0 dB\nat 1420 MHz, using 3 dB pad if the 2 dB pad fails." (at 13.97 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f1e490d6-3f57-562b-8bc8-778df922a1d3))
