(text "E4-09 — умова опції, не блокує випуск — STACK §3.1; §5.3 (BENCH); §8.1 RF-11" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 210.01 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 150 90 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 60cd49af-5cc7-5be1-87c7-c27cd1594a45))
(text "BENCH RF sled is not delivered as a separate HMC7992 + PE4312 PCB here.\nВорота (стенд): Deliver its PCB/netlist, controls and 31.5 dB startup test if installed. Until then use the\ninternal BENCH SMA with a qualified external conducted source." (at 13.97 212.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid d54b67e8-6564-5aa0-83d4-b30751399396))
