(text "E4-05 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §2.11.1; §8.1 L-12" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 301.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 05dcc354-c6bd-5208-b3cf-e7019e9724d7))
(text "Lime X2/X4 are the v1.2 RX ports, but which of them is RX-A and which RX-B is TBD (STACK §2.11.1, §8.1 L-12:\ncheck against the board marking). Pins are named X2_RX/X4_RX and nets E4_LIME_X2_RX/E4_LIME_X4_RX, so the\ndrawing fixes no channel; supplied-board cable labels need confirmation.\nВорота (стенд): Check the exact revision schematic and conduct a one-port-at-a-time RX test. Generic setup X3\nwording is not evidence." (at 13.97 303.55 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid fb127bb4-608a-5344-8ad7-3fe500159242))
